OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after fire spreads
OL,4,Athrough shops
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of homes have been evacuated
OL,7,Fafter a fire broke out in a row of
OL,8,Fshops and takeaway restaurants.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Fire and Rescue said
OL,11,Feight appliances were sent to Burghley
OL,12,FDrive, Corby, after it was called at
OL,13,Fabout 05:30 BST.
OL,15,FElectricity was cut off by National
OL,16,FGrid at 06:23 and about 70 properties
OL,17,Fhave been without power, the company
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
