OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after fire spreads
OL,4,Athrough shops
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo-one has been reported as being
OL,7,Finjured and the blaze has now been put
OL,8,Fout, with crews remaining at the scene
OL,9,Fto dampen down the site, the fire
OL,10,Fservice said.
